BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Tech Lancaster
UID:event_316261932@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041717Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260924T203000
SUMMARY:Tech Lancaster Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Tech Lancaster Meetups\nWe will be upstairs in "The Sanctuary"
  - when you walk in the main entrance just head up the stairs! We will hav
 e signs as you walk in to guide you.\nPizza is provided free upstairs. Bee
 r/wine/soda/etc at the bar downstairs!\n\nThis months speakers:\n**Shawn G
 allagher - *Untitled Medical Tech History Talk***\n\n**Todd Ritter - *Smar
 t home automation without selling your soul to Big Tech***\n\nAt its core\
 , true home automation is about shifting your living space from reactive t
 o proactive\, transforming a house full of isolated gadgets into a cohesiv
 e\, intelligent ecosystem. Instead of juggling dozens of fragmented\, vend
 or-locked cloud apps that stop working when the internet goes down\, a loc
 ally-controlled platform like Home Assistant allows you to unify your hard
 ware under one roof. We will review the hardware/software necessary to ach
 ieve this\, and the automation that becomes possible once you have central
 ized control of your home!\n\nHave something you want to share? Lets us kn
 ow and maybe fill in a hole!\n\nTypical schedule of events:\n\n6:30 PM Doo
 rs Open/Pizza/Mingle\n7:00 PM Introduction/Announcements\n7:05 PM First Sp
 eaker\n7:35 PM Break\n7:45 PM Speaker 2\n8:15 PM End
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/tech-lancaster-meetups/events/3162619
 32/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260825T000218Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T000218Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
